The '''Mechanical Workbench''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Fabricates vehicle chassis parts, wheels, and engines.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.MechanicalWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Mechanical</code>.

